# CCCP coop: track coordination state, NEVER payload (anti-pattern #6).
# Tracked by default: *.md, inboxes, reports, STATUS, RUN_STATE, small ledgers.
# Blocked: binaries / large artifacts / corpora anywhere under coop/.
*.pdf
*.npy
*.pkl
*.parquet
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz
*.7z
*.bin
# scratch is transient by default; force-add a small ledger if you must keep it.
scratch/*
!scratch/.gitkeep
